{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15216320","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15216320","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1521632001:0":{"text":"本当にありがとう。この石なら立派な墓石が作れそうだよ。","source_cn":"谢谢你们帮我找的石头。它很适合用来做墓碑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106EF32A6382B391","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521632002:0":{"text":"少しだけ待ってて……すぐに完成させるから。","source_cn":"请等我一会……我很快就能做完。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFB470FC069E4E9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1521632003:0":{"text":"ヴェルナーは黙々と石を打ち、徐々に墓石の形が整えられていった。","source_cn":"维尔纳沉默地在石头上敲敲打打，将它打磨成墓碑的形状。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0A30A7CD77AA2A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1521632004:0":{"text":"最後に彼は「グレッグ」という名を刻むと、モンスターが消えた場所にそれを立てた。","source_cn":"最后，他在墓碑上刻下了“格雷格”这个名字，将它竖立在怪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A8171A6A5A7C160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521632005:0":{"text":"グレッグ……これが父さんの名前だ。","source_cn":"格雷格……这是我父亲的名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BCCC7C2D8F1D107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521632006:0":{"text":"うちの一族は代々、トータス町で石職人を続けてきた。さまざまな祭礼で用いる神像から、子どもが身につける装飾まで、すべてうちが請け負っていたんだ。","source_cn":"我们家族世代都是图塔镇的石匠。大到教堂和各类祭祀的神像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA040986AED7E2F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521632007:0":{"text":"そして「シーイー」がうちの一族の姓だ。だから町の人たちはずっと、父さんのことを「マスター・シーイー」って呼んでたよ……","source_cn":"“石艺”是我们家族的姓氏。镇上的人也一直管我老爹叫“老...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFA0F8D048411248","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521632008:0":{"text":"グレッグなんて名前……本人でさえ忘れちまってるかもしれないな……","source_cn":"真正属于他自己的名字——格雷格，好像早就被人遗忘了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB6C479F9C302210","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1521632008":{"text":"グレッグなんて名前……本人でさえ忘れちまってるかもしれないな……","source_cn":"真正属于他自己的名字——格雷格，好像早就被人遗忘了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB6C479F9C302210","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521632009:0":{"text":"でも……シーイーの名はまだ途切れちゃいない。","source_cn":"格雷格会留在这里……但老石艺还不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA33A1EBB85D541E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume